# Scripts here run once, in filename order, when the postgres volume is first
# created. Reserved for cluster-level setup that must precede EF Core migrations:
# the keycloak schema, the unaccent extension (research.md D9), and the
# application role that T048 grants INSERT-only on audit_event.
#
# Application schema itself belongs in EF Core migrations (T026), never here —
# migrations are forward-only and reviewed; init scripts are neither.
